(text "USB 3 TX AC coupling, USB 2 series (lines 70; HDG p. 59)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 190.5 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a5d76c37-8faf-5fc1-a6a0-7292e35db3de"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: the HAT USB port on the board end of the flat cable (RFC 0015): USB 3 Gen 1, USB 2,\n   CC and VBUS to the device-side piece and its pogo field (hat-standard interface v2).\n2. Absent state: HAT or cable absent: no attach; the AC caps keep a dangling cable off the TX pair.\n3. Contacts per interface v2 §9.2: VBUS on 3-31 odd, GND on 4-32 even, 33, 39, 42, 45, 48;\n   CC 34; SSTX 35/37; SSRX 41/43; D± 44/46; 36, 38, 40, 47 spare; 1, 2, 49, 50 metal fittings.\n   Contact numbering against the Hirose drawing is UNVERIFIED (interface v2 §11 item 5).\n4. ESD and the VBUS TVS are on the device-side piece, none repeated here (BOM lines 65, 68, 69)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 228.6 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eceb997f-a4a0-5cac-aeb2-ebd73d0f5197"))
